## Naming Conventions

| Thing | Convention | Example |
|-------|-----------|---------|
| Files | kebab-case | `pilot-form.tsx` |
| Components | PascalCase | `PilotForm` |
| Server Actions | camelCase verb | `capturePilotLead` |
| DB models | PascalCase | `QueryEvent` |
| Env vars | SCREAMING_SNAKE | `RESEND_API_KEY` |
| CSS variables | kebab-case with `--` | `--color-brand-500` |
| Route segments | kebab-case | `review-queue` |

